msgid "A Persian-first WordPress theme for creative agencies and studios, with an English visitor interface and dedicated RTL styles. Includes a responsive landing page, editorial posts, and standard or full-width pages with optional breadcrumbs, featured images, and title styles. Its standalone settings dashboard controls the header, pages, posts, blog, sidebars, and footer. Supports Elementor pages and Theme Builder locations, with verified GitHub dashboard updates."
msgstr "A Persian-first WordPress theme for creative agencies and studios, with an English visitor interface and dedicated RTL styles. Includes a responsive landing page, editorial posts, and standard or full-width pages with optional breadcrumbs, featured images, and title styles. Its standalone settings dashboard controls the header, pages, posts, blog, sidebars, and footer. Supports Elementor pages and Theme Builder locations, with verified GitHub dashboard updates."

